---
// Legacy route URL retained so existing links remain useful. Winter routes are not final.
import RunnerPage from '../../layouts/RunnerPage.astro';
const wikilocUrl = 'https://es.wikiloc.com/rutas-carrera-por-montana/badall-trail-benigembla-ctm-2023-151013404';
---
<RunnerPage
  title="Winter routes · Costa Blanca Trail Camp"
  description="Winter 2027 routes are being finalised. Four days of trail running in the Costa Blanca mountains, with routes adapted to the group and weather."
  path="/routes/benigembla"
  eyebrow="Winter 2027 · Routes coming soon"
  heading="Our winter trails"
>
  <Fragment slot="lede">
    <p>We are choosing the routes for late January / February 2027. Expect around <strong>2–4 hours on the trails</strong>, depending on the day, with climbs, rocky descents, running, hiking and food stops.</p>
  </Fragment>
  <section class="rp-section">
    <h2 class="rp-h2">The mountains and the weather decide</h2>
    <p>We may change a route, shorten the day or run in the rain. We will share the confirmed routes, equipment and logistics with the group before camp.</p>
    <p>If you followed an older link to the Benigembla loop, that route is not a confirmed part of the winter programme. The original track is still available below for reference, not as a camp itinerary or current safety briefing.</p>
    <div class="rp-hero-actions">
      <a class="rp-btn rp-btn-solid" href="/#waitlist">Join the winter waitlist</a>
      <a class="rp-btn rp-btn-ghost" href={wikilocUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">View the original Benigembla track</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</RunnerPage>
